# No Cursor commit notes

Never leave Cursor agent notes on commits.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` (or any Cursor agent Signed-off-by / “Made with Cursor” trailer).
- This clone should use `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`; the `commit-msg` hook strips those lines automatically.
- If a commit message still contains them, amend only when the amend rules allow; otherwise make a follow-up that does not reintroduce them.
- Details: `AGENTS.md`.
